# Task-Aware Convolutional Networks for ARC

A lightweight, task-aware convolutional network pipeline developed for the **2026 NeuroGolf Championship**. This notebook explores the use of customized convolutional ONNX models tailored to individual ARC-AGI tasks, demonstrating a rule-inspired approach to task-specific neural network design.

